		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4225&amp;p=32027#p32027"><![CDATA[
All MD9600 use the same donor file<br><br>If you don't know how old the radio is, then you will need to try each version of OpenGD77 and see which version works with your radio<br><br>The display and controls will work for all radios even if you install the wrong version of OpenGD77, but the radio won't transmit or receive.<br><br>If the radio is not new, then its probably a V2 or possibly V1 radio<br><br>The only difference between V2 and V1 is the display dimming, and not many V1 radios were manufactured.<br><br>If V2 doesn't work, try the other versions<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Jul 07, 2024 7:34 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
